2026-09-11T16:04Z claude note CORRECTION to my own 16:03 notes and to the body: I read the body and not this log, and recommended running Action 1 to the author. Action 1 is impossible -- update_url is REQUIRED, established with a control 2026-09-06 (0.2.14, identical but for its removal, refused at install). The title's mechanism is refuted too (0.2.15 advertised a compatible version and died on the same schedule; interval is 86400 against a disable at +20s). Added a 'Read the log before this body' section so the next reader meets the supersessions before the filed text
